==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{m|fro|corteour}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|cortoiier}}, from {{m|fro|cort||court}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈkɔɹtiɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈkɔːtɪə/|lang=en}}
* {{a|rhotic|horse-hoarse}} {{IPA|/ˈko(ː)ɹtiɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{a|nonrhotic|horse-hoarse}} {{IPA|/ˈkoətɪə/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(ɹ)tiə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# A person in [[attendance]] at a [[royal]] [[court]].
